### 1. Register a new Doctor
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "doctor@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "name": "Dr. Sarah Johnson",
  "specialty": "Cardiology"
}

###

### 2. Login as the Doctor (Copy the token from the response)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "doctor@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 3. Add a new Patient (Paste the token where it says YOUR_TOKEN_HERE)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "age": 45,
  "gender": "Male",
  "phone": "123-456-7890",
  "email": "john@example.com"
}

###

### 4. Get all Patients for this Doctor (Paste your token here too)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/patients
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
